ment"&gt;Contributor Agreement&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="individual-contributor-exclusive-license-agreement"&gt;Individual Contributor exclusive License Agreement&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="including-the-traditional-patent-license-option"&gt;(including the TRADITIONAL PATENT LICENSE OPTION)&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in contributing to HugeGraph&amp;rsquo;s all projects (&amp;ldquo;We&amp;rdquo; or &amp;ldquo;Us&amp;rdquo;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this contributor agreement (&amp;ldquo;Agreement&amp;rdquo;) is to clarify and document the rights granted by contributors to Us. To make this document effective, please follow the comment of GitHub CLA-Assistant when submitting a new pull request.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>